          {
            "title": "Filtering",
            "id": 89386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan list comprehension untuk membuat list baru dengan memfilter elemen dari list yang sudah ada, seperti membuat list <code>high_scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>high_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan list comprehension untuk membuat list baru dengan memfilter elemen dari list yang sudah ada.</p><p>Pengujian <code>if</code> setelah loop hanya mempertahankan elemen yang membuat kondisinya true.</p><p>Buat <code>high_scores</code> dengan mempertahankan hanya skor yang lebih besar dari <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &gt;= 30\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &lt; 20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>high_scores</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 89387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita mulai seperti biasa dengan loop <code>for</code> untuk mengiterasi setiap elemen dalam list asli, seperti setiap <code>score in scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score</code>, lalu <code>in</code>, <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Awali comprehension ini dengan melakukan loop pada setiap <code>score</code> dalam <code>scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score</code>, <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Expression",
            "id": 89388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyalin setiap elemen <code>score</code> ke dalam list baru, kita menulis <code>score</code> sebagai ekspresi, tanpa menerapkan operasi apa pun.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[12, 47, 30, 29, 19, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 89389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memfilter elemen yang memenuhi kondisi tertentu, kita menambahkan pernyataan if, seperti di sini ketika kita hanya menyalin skor <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Process",
            "id": 89390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat list dalam <code>high_scores</code> dengan melakukan loop pada setiap <code>score</code> dalam <code>scores</code>, dan hanya menyalin <code>score</code> jika nilainya lebih besar dari 20.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>high_scores</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lakukan loop pada setiap <code>score</code> dalam <code>scores</code> dan salin <code>score</code> hanya jika lebih besar dari <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &gt; 29\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>score</code>, diikuti oleh <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Order",
            "id": 89391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat menggunakan conditional, urutan yang biasanya digunakan adalah memulai dengan expression, dilanjutkan dengan for loop, dan diakhiri dengan if statement.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>score</code>, diikuti oleh <code>for score in scores</code>, dan terakhir <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun comprehension secara berurutan: ekspresi, loop <code>for</code>, lalu pernyataan <code>if</code> yang mempertahankan skor di atas <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if score &gt; 29\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>score</code>, diikuti oleh <code>for score in scores</code>, dan terakhir <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Filtering",
            "id": 89677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisakah kita memfilter elemen-elemen dalam sebuah list dengan list comprehension?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya, dengan menambahkan kondisi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak, kita hanya bisa menyalin list dengan list comprehension</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ya, dengan menambahkan kondisi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin list comprehension mempertahankan hanya skor yang lulus. Apa yang harus ditambahkan setelah klausa <code>for</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Conditional yang memeriksa apakah setiap skor lulus</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ekspresi kedua yang mengubah setiap skor</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">List lain yang hanya berisi skor yang lulus</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Conditional yang memeriksa apakah setiap skor lulus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For loop",
            "id": 89678,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita masih memerlukan loop <code>for</code> saat memfilter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Agar bisa memeriksa kondisi untuk setiap elemen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak memerlukan loop saat menggunakan conditional dalam list comprehension</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Agar bisa memeriksa kondisi untuk setiap elemen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah comprehension mempertahankan suhu di atas <code>20</code>. Mengapa masih diperlukan loop <code>for</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk memeriksa kondisi bagi setiap suhu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop tidak diperlukan jika ada kondisi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memeriksa kondisi hanya sekali sebelum membaca list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk memeriksa kondisi bagi setiap suhu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Expression",
            "id": 89679,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat kita menggunakan variabel loop sebagai ekspresi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita menyalin list asli</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa hanya menggunakan variabel loop, karena akan mendapatkan error</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita menyalin list asli.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menggunakan variabel loop sebagai ekspresi akan menyalin setiap nilai asli ke list baru.</p><p>Kamu menetapkan <code>cities = [\"Oslo\", \"Oslo\", \"Lima\"]</code>. Apa hasil <code>[city for city in cities]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"Oslo\", \"Oslo\", \"Lima\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"Oslo\", \"Lima\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[True, True, True]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[\"Oslo\", \"Oslo\", \"Lima\"]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 89680,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berdasarkan kondisi di dalam list comprehension, elemen apa yang kita masukkan ke dalam list <code>apply_taxes</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"340\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apply_taxes = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &gt; \" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(apply_taxes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[200, 340]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elemen dalam <code>prices</code> yang lebih besar dari 150</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak menyaring elemen apa pun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elemen dalam <code>prices</code> yang lebih besar dari 150.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dicetak program setelah menerapkan kondisi ke setiap harga?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"340\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apply_taxes = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &gt; \" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(apply_taxes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[200, 340]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[200, 340]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[150, 200, 340]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[150, 45, 200, 340]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[200, 340]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Process",
            "id": 89681,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan list comprehension ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_prices = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"under_50 = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item_prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(under_50)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[25, 40]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini melakukan perulangan pada <code>item_prices</code> dan menyalin setiap nilai yang kurang dari <code>50</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini melakukan loop melalui <code>item_prices</code> dan menyalin setiap nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini melakukan perulangan pada <code>item_prices</code> dan menyalin setiap nilai yang kurang dari <code>50</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa <code>120</code> tidak ada dalam list yang dicetak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_prices = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"under_50 = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item_prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(under_50)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[25, 40]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai tersebut tidak memenuhi <code>price &lt; 50</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop melewati nilai pertama dalam setiap list</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Comprehension menyalin setiap nilai dan menghapus nilai terbesar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai tersebut tidak memenuhi <code>price &lt; 50</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
